{"_id":"8KOQS3F3HJ9P889G","name":"Stone Servant","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:stone-servant","level":5,"monsterType":"Golem","intelligence":"Servant","perception":"Magic","disposition":"Instructed","soulscars":0,"languages":"None","habitat":"Various","reputation":11,"weakness":15,"weakPoint":"Accuracy +1","initiative":13,"movementSpeed":"18","fortitude":"8 (15)","willpower":"7 (14)","source":"CR II p. 423","description":"Materials: Enchanted Stone (1,000/2,000)\n\nA golem made of stone, this golem is about 2 meters in size. As long as it has arms and legs, its shape can be freely set by the creator, but it cannot be made very precise, nor can its color or texture be changed. The shape does not make any difference in performance.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"◯ Stone Body","description":"A Stone Servant is immune to criticals from both Edged weapons and all non-Energy-type Magic damage.\nMaximum of Enhancing Items = 5\nCat's Eye Rivet (Medium) (800) ( ► Double Attack)\n└ Golden Cat's Eye Rivet (Medium) (800) ( ► Twin Strike &amp; Double Attack)\nJet Sign (Medium) (400) ( 🗨 Aimed Attack = +2 Accuracy and -4 damage)\nObsidian Shield (Medium) (600) ( 🗨 △ Cover II)\nCorundum Protection (Medium) (400) ( ◯ Guardian I)\nCoral Branch (Medium) (400) ( ◯ Block)\nAmber Eye (Medium) (2,000) ( ◯ Ultimate Aim = +4 Accuracy)\nGarnet of Vitality (Medium) (800) ( ◯ HP Enhancement = Max HP +10)\n└ Focused Garnet of Vitality (Medium) (1,200) ( ◯ Improved HP Enhancement = Max HP +10)\nRed Iron Blood (Medium) (400) ( ◯ Mobility Enhancement = Movement +5)\n2d |\nLoot |\n2 - 5 |\nNothing |\n6 - 12 |\nMagical Stone (250G/Gold A) |\n13+ |\nMithril (2,600G/Gold S) |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Stone Servant","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"CdFYkcqE1adfoCuJ","name":"Scale Flipper","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:scale-flipper","level":7,"monsterType":"Golem","intelligence":"Servant","perception":"Magic","disposition":"Instructed","soulscars":0,"languages":"None","habitat":"Various","reputation":12,"weakness":16,"weakPoint":"Physical Damage +2 points","initiative":13,"movementSpeed":"-/20 (Swimming)","fortitude":"10 (17)","willpower":"10 (17)","source":"CR II p. 425","description":"Materials: Enchanted Rock Slag (1,500/3,000)\n\nThis is a fish-shaped golem made of light, perforated rock.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"◯ Stone Body","description":"A Scale Flipper is immune to criticals from edged weapons and all magic damage, except for Energy-type damage."},{"title":"◯ Underwater","description":"Scale Flipper doesn't receive penalties for moving or taking action in the water. However, it can't perform any Action without water.\nMaximum of Enhancing Items = 4\n※ Head Only\nSpinel Horn (Medium) (600) ( ► Charge)\nBlue Lotus Jade (Medium) (1,600)"},{"title":"► Blizzard Breath/9 (16)/Fortitude/Half","description":"Golem sprays a jet of water with \"Range/Area: 20m/ Shot \" in a \"Target: 3m Radius/5\", dealing 2d+7 water/ice magic damage. This ability cannot be used on consecutive turns.\nCalcite Compound Eyes (Medium) (800) ( ◯ Breath Control)\n※ Body Only\nLapis Lazuli Weight (Medium) (800) ( 🗨 Tail Swing I)\n└ Quartz Counterweight (Medium) (1,200) ( 🗨 Tail Swing II)\n※ Any Section\nAmber Eye (Medium) (2,000) ( ◯ Ultimate Aim = +4 Accuracy)\nGarnet of Vitality (Medium) (800) ( ◯ HP Enhancement = Max HP +10)\n└ Focused Garnet of Vitality (Medium) (1,200) ( ◯ Improved HP Enhancement = Max HP +10)\n※ All Section Must be Equipped\nAnisotropic Anorthite (Medium) (600) (Ground movement 10 (crawling), [ ◯ Underwater Specialization])\n2d |\nLoot |\n2 - 10 |\nMagical Stone (250G/Gold A) |\n11+ |\nMithril (2,600G/Gold S) |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Scale Flipper","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"Hvg1LCaDulR63zGS","name":"Oak Hound","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:oak-hound","level":2,"monsterType":"Golem","intelligence":"Servant","perception":"Magic","disposition":"Instructed","soulscars":0,"languages":"None","habitat":"Various","reputation":8,"weakness":12,"weakPoint":"Fire Damage +3 points","initiative":10,"movementSpeed":"9 (4 Legs)","fortitude":"4 (11)","willpower":"4 (11)","source":"CR II p. 419","description":"Materials: Enchanted Oak Branch (50/100)\n\nThis quadrupedal golem is made of oak wood and, like the Oak Golem , is not very precisely sculpted.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Oak Hound","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"J9o0CN0B5PZU92XE","name":"Bronze Golem","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:bronze-golem","level":9,"monsterType":"Golem","intelligence":"Servant","perception":"Magic","disposition":"Instructed","soulscars":0,"languages":"None","habitat":"Various","reputation":14,"weakness":20,"weakPoint":"Energy damage +3 points","initiative":9,"movementSpeed":"11","fortitude":"12 (19)","willpower":"12 (19)","source":"CR III p. 435","description":"Materials: Enchanted Bronze (4,000/10,000)\n\nThis is a golem made of bronze about 3 to 4 meters tall.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"◯ Bronze Body","description":"The Bronze Golem is immune to criticals from edged weapons and all non-Energy-type Magic damage.\nMaximum of Enhancing Items = 5\n※ Any Section\nObsidian Shield (Large) (3,000) ( 🗨 △ Cover II)\nCorundum Protection (Large) (2,000) ( ◯ Guardian II)\nJet Sign (Large) (2,000) ( 🗨 Aimed Attack = +2 Accuracy and -4 damage)\nSunstone Brilliance (Large) (6,000) ( ► Brand=Next attack cannot be evaded, damage +6)\nAmber Eye (Large) (10,000) ( ◯ Ultimate Aim = +4 Accuracy)\nGarnet of Vitality (Large) (4,000) ( ◯ HP Enhancement = Max HP +15)\n└ Focused Garnet of Vitality (Large) (6,000) ( ◯ Improved HP Enhancement = Max HP +15)\nShimmering Onyx (Large) (600) ( ◯ Mana Coating = Magic damage -3)\n※ All Section Must be Equipped\nCoral Branch (Large) (2,000) ( ◯ Block)\nRed Iron Blood (Large) (2,000) ( ◯ Mobility Enhancement = Movement +5)\nMoonstone of Serenity (Large) (5,000) (Golem loses its Weak Point (it becomes \"None\"))\nQuartz Disruptor (Large) (5,000) ( ◯ Type Resistance)\n2d |\nLoot |\n2 - 7 |\nMagic Bronze (420G/Gold Black A) |\n8+ |\nMithril (2,600G/Gold S) |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Bronze Golem","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","sca