{"_id":"LDABEB5Ujb2rsW4h","name":"Rutile Raptor","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:rutile-raptor","level":10,"monsterType":"Golem","intelligence":"Servant","perception":"Magic","disposition":"Instructed","soulscars":0,"languages":"None","habitat":"Various","reputation":16,"weakness":21,"weakPoint":"Accuracy +1","initiative":16,"movementSpeed":"-/30(Flying)","fortitude":"12 (19)","willpower":"13 (20)","source":"CR III p. 436","description":"Materials: Enchanted Golden Redstone (6,000/15,000)\n\nThis is a bird-shaped golem with a golden-red stone body.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"◯ Golden Red Stone Body","description":"The Rutile Raptor is immune to criticals from edged weapons and all non-Energy-type Magic damage.\nBody"},{"title":"◯ Flight II","description":"All sections receive a +2 bonus to Accuracy and Evasion only for melee attacks.\nThis ability is lost if the HP of Body section falls to 0 or below.\nMaximum of Enhancing Items = 3\n※ Head Only\nBright Red Ruby (Large) (8,000)"},{"title":"► Flame Breath/12 (19)/Fortitude/Half","description":"Golem spits out the fire with \"Range/Area: 2 (20m)/ Shot \" and \"Target: 1 area (5m Radius)/10,\" dealing 2d+10 fire magic damage. This ability cannot be used on consecutive turns. It also cannot be used on the turn immediately after using [ ► Lightning].\nAmethyst of Purple Lightning (Large) (8,000)"},{"title":"► Lightning/12 (19)/Fortitude/Half","description":"Golem unleashes an electrical bolt with \"Range/Area: 50m/Line\", dealing 2d+10 lightning magic damage to the target. This ability cannot be used on consecutive turns. It also cannot be used on the turn immediately after using [ ► Flame Breath].\nCalcite Compound Eyes (Large) (4,000) ( ◯ Breath Control)\n※ Body Only\nObsidian Shield (Large) (3,000) ( 🗨 △ Cover II)\nMalachite Feather (Large) (3,000) ( 🗨 All-Out Attack=Damage +8, Evasion -3)\n※ Any Section\nAmber Eye (Large) (10,000) ( ◯ Ultimate Aim = +4 Accuracy)\nGarnet of Vitality (Large) (4,000) ( ◯ HP Enhancement = Max HP +15)\nShimmering Onyx (Large) (3,000) ( ◯ Mana Coating = Magic damage -3)\n※ All Section Must be Equipped\nRed Iron Blood (Large) (2,000) ( ◯ Mobility Enhancement = Movement +5)\nYellow Flint (Large) (4,000) ( ◯ Fast Reaction = [ Footwork ])\n2d |\nLoot |\n2 - 7 |\nEnchanted Gemstones (250G/Gold A) |\n8 - 12 |\nMithril (2,600G/Gold S) |\n13+ |\nPure Mithril (8,800G/Gold S) |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Rutile Raptor","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"MMJNgC2UrjlgiThY","name":"Platinum Dragon","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:platinum-dragon","level":13,"monsterType":"Golem","intelligence":"Servant","perception":"Magic","disposition":"Instructed","soulscars":0,"languages":"None","habitat":"Various","reputation":17,"weakness":23,"weakPoint":"Accuracy +1","initiative":20,"movementSpeed":"12/25(Flying)","fortitude":"17 (24)","willpower":"17 (24)","source":"CR III p. 439","description":"Materials: Enchanted Platinum (15,000/50,000)\n\nThis is a golem in the shape of a dragon, made of a solid alloy, mainly platinum.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"◯ Superalloy Body","description":"It is immune to criticals from magical or weapon attacks.\nBody"},{"title":"◯ Flight II","description":"All sections receive a +2 bonus to Accuracy and Evasion only for melee attacks.\nIt loses this ability if any of the Wing section HP becomes 0 or less.\nMaximum of Enhancing Items = 4\n※ Body Only\nBright Red Ruby (Large) (8,000)"},{"title":"► Flame Breath/15 (22)/Fortitude/Half","description":"Golem spits out the fire with \"Range/Area: 2 (20m) / Shot \" and \"Target: 1 area (5m Radius) / 10,\" dealing 2d+13 Fire magic damage.\nThis ability cannot be used in consecutive turns. It also cannot be used in the turn immediately after using [ ► Blizzard Breath] or [ ► Lightning].\nBlue Lotus Jade (Large) (8,000)"},{"title":"► Blizzard Breath/15 (22)/Fortitude/Half","description":"Golem sprays a jet of water with \"Range/Area: 20m / Shot \" in a \"Target: 4m Radius / 10\", dealing 2d+13 Water/Ice magic damage.\nThis ability cannot be used in consecutive turns. It also cannot be used in the turn immediately after using [ ► Flame Breath] or [ ► Lightning].\nAmethyst of Purple Lightning (Large) (8,000)"},{"title":"► Lightning/15 (22)/Fortitude/Half","description":"Golem unleashes an electrical bolt with \"Range/Area: 50m / Line \", dealing 2d+13 Lightning magic damage to the target.\nThis ability cannot be used in consecutive turns. It also cannot be used in the turn immediately after using [ ► Flame Breath] or [ ► Blizzard Breath].\nCalcite Compound Eyes (Large) (4,000) ( ◯ Breath Control)\nSpinel Horn (Large) (3,000) ( ► Charge)\nLapis Lazuli Weight (Large) (4,000) ( 🗨 Tail Swing I)\n└ Quartz Counterweight (Large) (6,000) ( 🗨 Tail Swing II)\n※ Wing Only\nObsidian Shield (Large) (3,000) ( 🗨 △ Cover II)\nCorundum Protection (Large) (2,000) ( ◯ Guardian II)\nMalachite Feather (Large) (3,000) ( 🗨 All-Out Attack=Damage +8, Evasion -3)\n※ Any Section\nAmber Eye (Large) (10,000) ( ◯ Ultimate Aim = +4 Accuracy)\nGarnet of Vitality (Large) (4,000) ( ◯ HP Enhancement = Max HP +15)\n└ Focused Garnet of Vitality (Large) (6,000) ( ◯ Improved HP Enhancement = Max HP +15)\nShimmering Onyx (Large) (3,000) ( ◯ Mana Coating = Magic damage -3)\n※ All Section Must be Equipped\nRed Iron Blood (Large) (2,000) ( ◯ Mobility Enhancement = Movement +5)\nYellow Flint (Large) (4,000) ( ◯ Fast Reaction = [ Footwork ])\nQuartz Disruptor (Large) (5,000) ( ◯ Type Resistance)\n2d |\nLoot |\n2 - 5 |\nMagic Iron Ingot (680G/Gold Black A) |\n6 - 11 |\nMithril (2,600G/Gold S) |\n12+ |\nPure Mithril (8,800G/Gold S) |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Platinum Dragon","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":