{"_id":"ZRtU8kTwO63AhsYL","name":"Loam Puppet","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:loam-puppet","level":3,"monsterType":"Golem","intelligence":"Servant","perception":"Magic","disposition":"Instructed","soulscars":0,"languages":"None","habitat":"Various","reputation":12,"weakness":15,"weakPoint":"Accuracy +1","initiative":10,"movementSpeed":"10","fortitude":"5 (12)","willpower":"5 (12)","source":"CR II p. 420","description":"Materials: Enchanted Clay (200/300)\n\nA golem made from clay is the hopes and desires of its creator-given form. Typically standing around 1m, a Loam Puppet is often humanoid, though it can be any shape the creator wishes. The shape does not make any difference in performance.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"◯ Earth Immunity","description":""},{"title":"◯ Mud Body","description":"Blunt weapons treat the Loam Puppet's Defense as 5 points higher.\nIn addition, a Loam Puppet is immune to criticals from edged weapons.\nMaximum of Enhancing Items = 4\nObsidian Shield (Small) (150) ( 🗨 △ Cover I)\nCorundum Protection (Small) (100) ( ◯ Guardian I)\nCat's Eye Rivet (Small) (200) ( ► Double Attack)\n└ Golden Cat's Eye Rivet (Small) (200) ( ► Twin Strike &amp; Double Attack)\nAmber Eye (Small) (500) ( ◯ Ultimate Aim = +4 Accuracy)\nGarnet of Vitality (Small) (200) ( ◯ HP Enhancement = Max HP +5)\nRed Iron Blood (Small) (100) ( ◯ Mobility Enhancement = Movement +5)\n2d |\nLoot |\n2 - 7 |\nNothing |\n8+ |\nEnchanted Clay (250G/Gold Green A) |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Loam Puppet","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"a3wlxHB25ui1fmiL","name":"Oak Golem","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:oak-golem","level":2,"monsterType":"Golem","intelligence":"Servant","perception":"Magic","disposition":"Instructed","soulscars":0,"languages":"None","habitat":"Various","reputation":8,"weakness":12,"weakPoint":"Fire Damage +3 points","initiative":9,"movementSpeed":"9","fortitude":"4 (11)","willpower":"4 (11)","source":"CR II p. 419","description":"Materials: Enchanted Oak Branch (50/100)\n\nOak Golems are made from oak wood. They are humanoid, with a short and stocky form.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Oak Golem","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"fjiwfIA3inu35jpB","name":"Iron Golem","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:iron-golem","level":11,"monsterType":"Golem","intelligence":"Servant","perception":"Magic","disposition":"Instructed","soulscars":0,"languages":"None","habitat":"Various","reputation":16,"weakness":22,"weakPoint":"Energy damage +3 points","initiative":9,"movementSpeed":"12","fortitude":"14 (21)","willpower":"14 (21)","source":"CR III p. 437","description":"Materials: Enchanted Iron (8,000/20,000)\n\nThis is a massive golem made of iron which stands about 5 meters tall.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"◯ Iron Body","description":"The Iron Golem is immune to criticals from edged weapons and all non-Energy-type Magic damage.\nMaximum of Enhancing Items = 5\n※ Any Section\nObsidian Shield (Large) (3,000) ( 🗨 △ Cover II)\nCorundum Protection (Large) (2,000) ( ◯ Guardian II)\nJet Sign (Large) (2,000) ( 🗨 Aimed Attack = +2 Accuracy and -4 damage)\nSunstone Brilliance (Large) (6,000) ( ► Brand=Next attack cannot be evaded, damage +7)\nAmber Eye (Large) (10,000) ( ◯ Ultimate Aim = +4 Accuracy)\nGarnet of Vitality (Large) (4,000) ( ◯ HP Enhancement = Max HP +15)\n└ Focused Garnet of Vitality (Large) (6,000) ( ◯ Improved HP Enhancement = Max HP +15)\nShimmering Onyx (Large) (600) ( ◯ Mana Coating = Magic damage -3)\n※ All Section Must be Equipped\nCoral Branch (Large) (2,000) ( ◯ Block)\nRed Iron Blood (Large) (2,000) ( ◯ Mobility Enhancement = Movement +5)\nMoonstone of Serenity (Large) (5,000) (Golem loses its Weak Point (it becomes \"None\"))\nQuartz Disruptor (Large) (5,000) ( ◯ Type Resistance)\n2d |\nLoot |\n2 - 7 |\nMagic Iron Ingot (680G/Gold Black A) |\n8 - 12 |\nMithril (2,600G/Gold S) |\n13+ |\nPure Mithril (8,800G/Gold S) |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Iron Golem","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"meneypJgWRddEqSl","name":"Granite Shell","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:granite-shell","level":12,"monsterType":"Golem","intelligence":"Servant","perception":"Magic","disposition":"Instructed","soulscars":0,"languages":"None","habitat":"Various","reputation":17,"weakness":22,"weakPoint":"Energy damage +3 points","initiative":17,"movementSpeed":"10 (4 Legs)/30(Swimming)","fortitude":"16 (23)","willpower":"16 (23)","source":"CR III p. 438","description":"Materials: Enchanted Granite (10,000/25,000)\n\nThis is a large golem in the shape of a sea turtle with a granite shell.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"◯ Rock Body","description":"A Granite Shell is immune to criticals from edged weapons and all magic damage, except Energy-type damage."},{"title":"◯ Underwater Specialization","description":"Can move in water without penalties and restrictions. Conversely, all action checks are subject to a -2 penalty on the ground.\nBody"},{"title":"► Shell Guard","description":"The Granite Shell can retract into its shell, increasing its Defense by +10 for 10 seconds (1 round).\nMaximum of Enhancing Items = 4\n※ Head Only\nSpinel Horn (Large) (3,000) ( ► Charge)\nBlue Lotus Jade (Large) (8,000)"},{"title":"► Blizzard Breath/14 (21)/Fortitude/Half","description":"Golem sprays a jet of water with \"Range/Area: 20m/ Shot \" in a \"Target: 4m Radius/10\", dealing 2d+12 water/ice magic damage. This ability cannot be used on consecutive turns.\nCalcite Compound Eyes (Large) (4,000) ( ◯ Breath Control)\n※ Body Only\nObsidian Shield (Large) (3,000) ( 🗨 △ Cover II)\nCorundum Protection (Large) (2,000) ( ◯ Guardian II)\nLapis Lazuli Weight (Large) (4,000) ( 🗨 Tail Swing I)\n└ Quartz Counterweight (Large) (6,000) ( 🗨 Tail Swing II)\n※ Any Section\nAmber Eye (Large) (10,000) ( ◯ Ultimate Aim = +4 Accuracy)\nGarnet of Vitality (Large) (4,000) ( ◯ HP Enhancement = Max HP +15)\n└ Focused Garnet of Vitality (Large) (6,000) ( ◯ Improved HP Enhancement = Max HP +15)\nShimmering Onyx (Large) (3,000) ( ◯ Mana Coating = Magic damage -3)\n※ All Section Must be Equipped\nRed Iron Blood (Large) (2,000) ( ◯ Mobility Enhancement = Movement +5)\n2d |\nLoot |\nAlways |\nMagical Stone (250G/Gold A) x 2d |\n2 - 6 |\nNone |\n7 - 11 |\nMithril (2,600G/Gold S) |\n12+ |\nPure Mithril (8,800G/Gold S) |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Granite Shell","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"mmY4iR1aUlaTXbA0","name":"Brasswing","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:brasswing","level":6,"monsterType":"Golem","intelligence":"Servant","perception":"Magic","disposition":"Instructed","soulscars":0,"languages":"None","habitat":"Various","reputation":11,"weakness":15,"weakPoint":"Bludgeoning Damage +3 points","initiative":13,"movementSpeed":"-/25 (Flying)","fortitude":"8 (15)","willpower":"8 (15)","source":"CR II p. 424","description":"Materials: Enchanted Brass (1,500/3,000)\n\nThis bird-shaped golem is made by layering thin sheets of brass.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"◯ Brass Body","description":"A Brasswing is immune to criticals from edged weapons and all magic damage, except for Energy-type damage.\nBody"},{"title":"◯ Flight","description":"A Brasswing receives a +1 bonus to Accuracy and Evasion only for melee attacks.\nMaximum of Enhancing Items = 3\n※ Head Only\nBright Red Ruby (Medium) (1,600)"},{"title":"► Flame Breath/8 (15)/Fortitude/Half","description":"Golem spits out the fire with \"Range/Area: 2 (20m)/ Shot \" and \"Target: 1 area (3m Radius)/5,\" dealing 2d+6 Fire magic damage. This ability cannot be used on consecutive turns. It also cannot be used on the turn immediately after using [ ► Lightning].\nAmethyst of Purple Lightning (Medium) (1,600)"},{"title":"► Lightning/8 (15)/Fortitude/Half","description":"Golem unleashes an electrical bolt with \"Range/Area: 30m/ Line \", dealing 2d+6 Lightning magic damage to the target. This ability cannot be used on consecutive turns. It also cannot be used on the turn immediately after using [ ► Flame Breath].\nCalcite Compound Eyes (Medium) (800) ( ◯ Breath Control)\n※ Body Only\nObsidian Shield (Medium) (600) ( 🗨 △ Cover II)\nMalachite Feather (Medium) (600) ( 🗨 All-Out Attack=Damage +8, Evasion -3)\n※ Any Section\nAmber Eye (Medium) (2,000) ( ◯ Ultimate Aim = +4 Accuracy)\nGarnet of Vitality (Medium) (800) ( ◯ HP Enhancement = Max HP +10)\nShimmering Onyx (Medium) (600) ( ◯ Mana Coating = Magic damage -3)\n※ All Section Must be Equipped\nRed Iron Blood (Medium) (400) ( ◯ Mobility Enhancement = Movement +5)\nYellow Flint (Medium) (800) ( ◯ Fast Reaction = [ Footwork ])\n2d |\nLoot |\n2 - 5 |\nNothing |\n6 - 12 |\nMagical Brass (400G/Gold Black A) |\n13+ |\nMithril (2,600G/Gold S) |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Brasswing","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":"mp"},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":false,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":null}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"flags":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false},"items":[],"effects":[],"sort":0}
{"_id":"rwRzOX9oIpyz33e1","name":"Rock Golem","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:rock-golem","level":8,"monsterType":"Golem","intelligence":"Servant","perception":"Magic","disposition":"Instructed","soulscars":0,"languages":"None","habitat":"Various","reputation":13,"weakness":18,"weakPoint":"Energy damage +3 points","initiative":8,"movementSpeed":"10","fortitude":"11 (18)","willpower":"11 (18)","source":"CR II p. 426","description":"Materials: Enchanted Rock (2,000/5,000)\n\nRock Golems are humanoid constructs built entirely out of rocks of various sizes which stand menacingly at around 3m tall.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"◯ Rock Body","description":"The Rock Golem is immune to criticals from edged weapons and all non-Energy-type Magic damage.\nMaximum of Enhancing Items = 5\n※ Any Section\nObsidian Shield (Medium) (600) ( 🗨 △ Cover II)\nCorundum Protection (Medium) (400) ( ◯ Guardian I)\nJet Sign (Medium) (400) ( 🗨 Aimed Attack = +2 Accuracy and -4 damage)\nSunstone Brilliance (Medium) (1,200) ( ► Brand=Next attack cannot be evaded, damage +5)\nAmber Eye (Medium) (2,000) ( ◯ Ultimate Aim = +4 Accuracy)\nGarnet of Vitality (Medium) (800) ( ◯ HP Enhancement = Max HP +10)\n└ Focused Garnet of Vitality (Medium) (1,200) ( ◯ Improved HP Enhancement = Max HP +10)\nShimmering Onyx (Medium) (600) ( ◯ Mana Coating = Magic damage -3)\n※ All Section Must be Equipped\nCoral Branch (Medium) (400) ( ◯ Block)\nRed Iron Blood (Medium) (400) ( ◯ Mobility Enhancement = Movement +5)\nMoonstone of Serenity (Medium) (1,000) (Golem loses its Weak Point (it becomes \"None\"))\nQuartz Disruptor (Medium) (1,000) ( ◯ Type Resistance)\n2d |\nLoot |\n2 - 8 |\nMagical Stone (250G/Gold A) |\n9+ |\nMithril (2,600G/Gold S) |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Rock Golem","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","an