{"_id":"vEMoS4N1JN1HpL4F","name":"Leather Fish","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:leather-fish","level":4,"monsterType":"Golem","intelligence":"Servant","perception":"Magic","disposition":"Instructed","soulscars":0,"languages":"None","habitat":"Various","reputation":12,"weakness":15,"weakPoint":"Physical damage +2 points","initiative":10,"movementSpeed":"-/15 (Swimming)","fortitude":"6 (13)","willpower":"6 (13)","source":"CR II p. 421","description":"Materials: Enchanted Leather (300/500)\n\nThis fish-shaped golem is made from animal skin. It does not have scales and has a slimy texture.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"◯ Underwater","description":"Leather Fish doesn't receive penalties for moving or taking action in the water. However, it can't perform any Action without water.\nMaximum of Enhancing Items = 3\nLapis Lazuli Weight (Small) (200) ( 🗨 Tail Swing I)\n└ Quartz Counterweight (Small) (300) ( 🗨 Tail Swing II)\nBlue Lotus Jade (Small) (600)"},{"title":"► Water Gun/5 (12)/Fortitude/Half","description":"Golem sprays a jet of water with \"Range/Area: 2 (20m)/ Shot \" onto \"Target: 1 Character\", dealing 2d+4 water/ice magic damage and causing it to fall prone. Stray shots cannot occur with this ability.\nAmber Eye (Small) (500) ( ◯ Ultimate Aim = +4 Accuracy)\nGarnet of Vitality (Small) (200) ( ◯ HP Enhancement = Max HP +5)\nAnisotropic Anorthite (Small) (150) (Ground movement 10 (crawling), [ ◯ Underwater Specialization])\n2d |\nLoot |\n2 - 8 |\nNothing |\n9+ |\nEnchanted Leather (150G/Gold Red A) |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Leather Fish","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attri