{"_id":"xBGR5Asd6U9VC5sP","name":"Straw Bird","type":"monster","system":{"revealed":false,"sourceUrl":"https://sw25.wikidot.com/monster:straw-bird","level":3,"monsterType":"Golem","intelligence":"Servant","perception":"Magic","disposition":"Instructed","soulscars":0,"languages":"None","habitat":"Various","reputation":10,"weakness":13,"weakPoint":"Fire Damage +3 points","initiative":13,"movementSpeed":"-/25 (Flying)","fortitude":"5 (12)","willpower":"5 (12)","source":"CR II p. 420","description":"Materials: Enchanted Straw Bundle (100/200)\n\nThis lightweight bird-shaped golem is made of woven grass stalks.","combatStyles":[],"uniqueSkills":[{"title":"◯ Fire Vulnerability","description":"When Straw Bird is hit by Fire-type damage, it takes an extra 3 damage."},{"title":"◯ Flight","description":"A Straw Bird receives a +1 bonus to Accuracy and Evasion only for melee attacks.\nMaximum of Enhancing Items = 2\nMalachite Feather (Small) (150) ( 🗨 All-Out Attack=Damage +8, Evasion -3)\nAmethyst of Purple Lightning (Small) (600)"},{"title":"► Discharge/4 (11)/Willpower/Half","description":"Golem unleashes an electrical bolt with \"Range/Area: 2 (20m) / Shot \", dealing 2d+3 lightning magic damage. Stray shots cannot occur with this ability.\nGarnet of Vitality (Small) (200) ( ◯ HP Enhancement = Max HP +5)\nRed Iron Blood (Small) (100) ( ◯ Mobility Enhancement = Movement +5)\nMoonstone of Serenity (Small) (250) (Remove [ ○ Fire Vulnerability], and Weak Point \"None\").\n2d |\nLoot |\n2 - 6 |\nNothing |\n7+ |\nEnchanted Straw Bundle (150G/Gold Green A) |"}],"lootTable":[]},"img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","prototypeToken":{"name":"Straw Bird","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"width":1,"height":1,"depth":1,"texture":{"src":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"hp"},"bar2":{"attribute"